   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I'll Remember You, Love**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Dealing Dispair**: back after 76 archived shows (605 days); rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **I Miss The Missisippi And You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **In Case You Ever Change Your Mind**: back after 85 archived shows (648 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Dark Hollow**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **The Beginning of The End**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-10** (recommended): audience recording; 23 songs; 149 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The BOK Center currently doesn't welcome tapers, so the uploader made a stealth recording as their only option [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-12-10**: taped by Tulsa Taper; transferred by Michael Treat; source: AUD: Zoom IQ7>iPhone 14Pro [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings BOK Center Fall '24 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/bok-center-fall-24-regular-poster/) [3]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [Billy Strings Poster For Show In Tulsa Oklahoma At Bok Center On December 10 2024 Home Decor Poster Canvas - Reverholic](https://reverholic.com/product/billy-strings-poster-for-show-in-tulsa-oklahoma-at-bok-center-on-december-10-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [4]",
